d lips   body shape: medium height, petite frame but well-defined musculature distribution, maturely developed chest volume, flat toned midsection, powerful leg curvature definition   hairstyle: glossy black long hair cut at shoulder length, slightly voluminous ends framing one side of face naturally draped down   outfit theme: nurse uniform transformation fused with suggestive sensual styling   clothing type: pure white form-fitting body suit (modified qipao silhouette), featuring navy-blue embroidered trim around collar and sleeves, center-chest vertically slit design forming “y” shaped transparent panel opening, rear hidden drawstring adjustment system embedded in fabric seam   pants/skirt: no traditional trousers or hemmed skirts worn instead a pair of white satin bow-tie suspender-style garter strings extending from hip peak downward creating open thong-like support framework   shoes: white velvet stiletto heel single-hole platform pumps, approximately 8cm tall heels, central horizontal buckle strap securing ankle for anti-slip function on foot sole surface   stockings: full-length thick cotton thigh-high socks covering entire lower limbs, soft matte texture smooth to touch, no patterns printed, three parallel navy-blue adhesive stripe markings sewn near upper calf area just below knee joint line, character, 人物：亚洲年轻女性模特   长相：面部轮廓硬朗清秀，眉弓凸起，鼻梁挺拔，红唇鲜艳   身材：身高适中，骨架偏小但肌肉分布均匀，躯干比例完美，胸部发育成熟饱满，腰腹扁平紧致，臀腿线条张力强   发型：乌黑亮泽长发齐肩长度，发梢略显蓬松弧度，不夹刘海也不扎辫子，自然散落遮挡一侧脸颊   装扮：护士制服变装+性暗示风格融合造型   衣服：白色修身版型连体紧身衣（类似旗袍改良款式），领口和袖口均有蓝色织锦滚边装饰，胸口中心部位被纵向切缝打开形成“y”字形裂痕透视区，背后隐藏抽绳调节系统   裤子/裙子：无裤装或传统裙摆，取而代之的是自臀峰向下延伸的一对白色缎面蝴蝶结系带构成开放式丁字裤形态支撑结构   鞋子：白色绒面高跟坡跟单孔尖头皮鞋，鞋跟高度约8厘米以上，鞋面中部设有一圈横向环扣用于束缚脚踝防止滑脱   丝袜：全身覆盖白色加厚棉质过膝长筒袜，质地柔软亲肤，表面平整无印花，袜筒顶部靠近膝盖下方镶嵌三条平行蓝色胶粘条纹标记marciananikke, characterstyle, masterpiece, best quality,cartoon, rabbit, tiny toon adventures, charactercharacterwoman, power drift, charactercharacter, hatsukoi limited, woman, bessho koyoiwoman, power drift, characterarchitecture, brutalist, towers,